        with :func:`~jax.jit` or other JAX transformations.
      - ``"clip"``: clip out-of-bound indices to valid range.
      - ``"wrap"``: wrap out-of-bound indices to valid range.
      - ``"ignore"``: do not coerce or check input indices. Behavior is
